{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55496","headline":"句 · 张洎","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风物一堆灰。\n（见《绀珠集》卷十一引《金坡遗事》。\n）（〖1〗《金坡遗事》：「张洎文章清赡。\n在江南日，将命入贡。\n还作十诗以訾诋京师，有『风物一堆灰』句。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张洎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}